#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_authentication.rst:273
msgid ""
"In the service file, the name of the service must be in the form of ``auth."
"provider.oauth.service.<service name>`` in order for phpBB to properly "
"recognise it."
msgstr ""
"In the service file, the name of the service must be in the form of ``auth."
"provider.oauth.service.<service name>`` in order for phpBB to properly "
"recognise it."
